<section id="A5.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.7 </span>Claude Lesson Generation Prompt</h3>

<div id="A5.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">After each curriculum stage, the following prompt was sent to the Claude Opus 4.1 model via the Anthropic API to generate the strategic lesson for the next stage. Placeholders were filled dynamically with data from the completed stage.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="A5.SS7.p2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx222" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx222.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">You</span><span id="lstnumberx222.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">are</span><span id="lstnumberx222.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">analyzing</span><span id="lstnumberx222.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">results</span><span id="lstnumberx222.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">from</span><span id="lstnumberx222.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx222.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">game</span><span id="lstnumberx222.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">theory</span><span id="lstnumberx222.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">experiment</span><span id="lstnumberx222.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">to</span><span id="lstnumberx222.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">extract</span><span id="lstnumberx222.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">strategic</span><span id="lstnumberx222.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">lessons</span><span id="lstnumberx222.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">for</span><span id="lstnumberx222.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">AI</span><span id="lstnumberx222.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx222.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">agents</span><span id="lstnumberx222.32" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span>
</div>
